SUMMARY:The Yolo Center for Language and Literacy: Navigating Changes to Language & Literacy Policy in CA Webinar
DESCRIPTION:The Yolo Center for Language and Literacy invites educators to join a virtual learning session on recent legislative updates affecting language and literacy assessment\, instruction\, and funding. Register at tinyurl.com/myjhrndk. It is on November 9\, 9am-11am via Zoom. \nTopics include:\n▪️Assembly Bill 2555: English Learner Reclassification changes\n▪️TK-8 ELA/ELD Instructional Materials Follow-Up Adoption\n▪️Assembly Bill 121: Literacy Professional Development Programs\, funding allocations\, and reporting
URL:https://hatefreetogether.org/event/the-yolo-center-for-language-and-literacy-navigating-changes-to-language-literacy-policy-in-ca-webinar/
LOCATION:Zoom
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://hatefreetogether.org/wp-content/uploads/California-Literacy-Policy-Webinar-Flyer.png
END:VEVENT
